  "name": "AI Event Management Platform - Workflow 1: Participant Registration",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1: Participant Registration\n\n**Purpose:** Capture participant registration via form, generate a unique Participant ID (EVT-000X), store the record in Google Sheets, and send a confirmation email.\n\n**Error Handling Strategy:**\n- Critical nodes (Sheets write, Gmail send) use `retryOnFail` (1 retry)\n- On final failure, execution routes to the error output branch\n- Errors are logged to a dedicated `ErrorLog` sheet\n- Workflow continues gracefully instead of halting entirely",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "8abae1a0-95cb-48a7-bd48-48799286eb9f",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
