      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error Handling Branch\n\nWhen `Get Existing Participants`, `Generate Participant ID`, `Save Registration to Sheet`, or `Send Confirmation Email` fail after 1 retry, execution flows here instead of stopping the workflow.\n\n1. **Format Error Details** - normalizes the error payload\n2. **Log Error to Sheet** - appends to the `ErrorLog` sheet for later review\n\nThis ensures the workflow degrades gracefully rather than crashing entirely, and gives admins full visibility into failed registrations.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c7128f5a-b83e-4fa7-8be0-8b4cef4c5469",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Error Handling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
